BUT the tree must stay frozen during the full-suite run! I already started it. Per the pack's B6: files changed while a verification run is in flight → the run is stale; let it finish, then rerun. This fix is critical for correctness (self-heal would throw/do nothing). Make the edit NOW, let the current run finish (it validates everything else), then run a fresh full suite. Actually better: make the edit now, kill the in-flight run? B6 says do NOT kill mid-flight; let it finish, treat as stale, start fresh. But it takes ~3.5 min... Alternatively let it run (it still gives regression signal for the rest), apply the fix, then rerun full suite once. Accept the extra cycle.

Edit githubSource heal: replace
```
