                       if (smProviderModule && typeof smProviderModule.ioCacheDrop === 'function') {
                           try {
                               smProviderModule.ioCacheDrop(repoInfo.owner, repoInfo.repo, 'openPrs', null);
                           } catch (e2) { /* probe-only */ }
                       }
```

Also check: in the test env, githubSource gets smProvider mapped as `{createSmProvider: ...}` only → smProviderModule.ioCacheDrop undefined → guarded → skip. Fine — tests for the heal would need the drop; my mutexRegistry tests don't cover this site. Acceptable.

